/-!
# Shared four-letter products for J3 B-row certificates

The evaluator forces each intermediate natural number before looking up the
next packed permutation. The 76 blocks are the four-letter subwords occurring
in the lower seed identities. BlockChecks certifies each packed block on all
6156 letters; Blocks transports those checks to the original permutations.
Source: ATLAS J3G1-p6156B0 and Order/data/witnesses.json.
Generated by generate.py; all generated numerical claims are kernel checked.
-/
set_option Elab.async false
